msgctxt "80"
msgid "Hey! Are you with those guys from before!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "92"
msgid ""
"Wait, don't touch my beautiful face! Go for the meh parts of me... Maybe my "
"forearms? I've always thought they were too skinny."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid "...Wait a sec! Kiryu-san!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"You're that guy I met in Okinawa! Mack, right? What are you\r\n"
"doing up in Kamurocho?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid ""
"Didn't I tell you I was gonna travel the world in search of\r\n"
"the perfect shot? Well it just so happens this grimy old town was the first "
"stop on my global getaway!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid ""
"Gotta keep it local before I let the Mack Attack loose on the unsuspecting "
"people of the world, y'know?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid "...Forget I asked. Why did you run from me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid ""
"Well think about it! I just strolled up to see the most\r\n"
"amazing flash of fists break out in some random little\r\n"
"alleyway. One lone man versus an entire thug army!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid ""
"My eyes were superglued to that shit, man! So I kept\r\n"
"watching, thinking maybe I'd finally snag the perfect shot\r\n"
"I've been looking for all these years."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid "But the scuffle was over before my shutter even clicked."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid ""
"Then outta the blue, the guy who kicked those American asses\r\n"
"to kingdom come starts coming my way! I was quaking in my goddamn boots!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid "So I ran. Never would've guessed that macho man was you, Kiryu-san!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid ""
"You, uh... take photos of random street fights? Whatever.\r\n"
"It's safe to say you're not working with those guys."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid ""
"Me? Of course not, Kiryu-san! I know I've got the scary suit\r\n"
"and all, but I wouldn't hurt a fly! Or anything else, for that matter!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid ""
"By the way, you got some legs on you, Kiryu-san! They used\r\n"
"to call me the Scampering Chicken on my high school track\r\n"
"team, but man you're on a whole 'nother level!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid ""
"Y'know what? I think it's fate that we crossed paths here\r\n"
"today. Actually, I'm sure of it! Nothing but the sweet\r\n"
"string of destiny could bring us back together."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid "Which reminds me. I got a special place I wanna show you. Interested?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid "...As long as it's nothing weird."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid "Oh, you don't have to worry about that. Let's go!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid "Actually, let's not! It's email time!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid "............"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid ""
"Welp, let's just forget I ever invited you! Buddy of mine in\r\n"
"town just asked me out for a drink, and I'm not the kinda\r\n"
"guy to say no to a drink."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid "Sorry, gotta jet!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "380"
msgid "Wait... You have friends?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid ""
"Heck yeah I do! This one's a special friend, over in that\r\n"
"special place I was telling you about. And hey, I've got\r\n"
"pals in like 13 different time zones!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "404"
msgid ""
"Anyway, Kiryu-san. I'll roll out the red carpet for you some\r\n"
"time, yeah?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "416"
msgid "Catch you later!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "440"
msgid "Uh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "452"
msgid ""
"(Well he's an... interesting guy. I'm sure I'll run into him\r\n"
"again sooner or later.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "464"
msgid ""
"(At least he's out of my hair, though. Now to get to the\r\n"
"Millennium Tower and meet with Kashiwagi-san.)"
msgstr ""

